# Claude folder-trust pre-seed rules
# Scopes the core source that pre-seeds ~/.claude.json folder-trust at worktree
# creation (the new claudetrust leaf package + its single call site in Prepare)
# plus the E2E scenario that asserts the seeded trust keys. Changes to these
# should trigger the coordinator-workflow scenario, which drives a real
# `plan init --worktree --anchor` and verifies the per-path trust keys land in
# the sandbox ~/.claude.json. Paths are relative to the flow repo root.

../core/pkg/claudetrust/seeder.go
../core/pkg/workspace/prepare.go
../core/util/pathutil/normalize.go
tests/e2e/tend/scenarios/coordinator_workflow.go
